    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25742" root="ضرح" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْسٌ ضَرُوحٌ</span></b>  <i>A bow that propels the arrow with
vehemence;</i> (S, A, K; *) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرُوحٌ</span> [q. v.].
(S and O and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طرح</span>.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَابَّةٌ ضَرُوحٌ</span>
<i>A beast that kicks with its hind leg</i> (S, K) [or
<i>with its fore legs:</i> see 1].

